"update": 1,
"values": ["[shake]
A game by Paledoptera

[color=white]Kordacpz
[color=505050]FRIEND Lipsyncing
Dess portraits

[color=white]Zeno
[color=505050]Dess cover art
Title screen art

[color=white]Erduardito
[color=505050]Gaster's lab environment art", "[shake]
A tribute to
WAITRESS
(the band, not the musical)", "[shake]
A tribute to
WAITRESS
(the band, not the musical)


Music used (in order)
[color=505050]Everhood 2 OST  - Main Menu 
Deltarune OST - findher.ogg
Waitress - Here Come The Cats
Waitress - The Great Forever
Waitress - Rubio's Lament
", "
[wave]
Inspired by:
[color=505050]
- Two incredible animations
by Faz and marineflames
- Vision Crew's Alternate Chapter 6

[color=WHITE]
Thank you to:
Airplane
[color=505050]for the Background sketches", "[wave]
Special thanks to our playtesters:
[color=505050]
etc etc etc

[color=WHITE]
And our early supporters!
[color=505050]
Waitress! (of course!)
Angelvision
tizielechicero
Spoofymaru
Soup Taels
Ectoplasm & Visioncord
ArtsyAria (my love <3)

", "[wave]", "





Thanks for playing!

Return to title"]
}
